# Input for packaging/requirements-macos-arm64.txt (the hash-pinned lock that
# packaging/build_macos.sh installs). See packaging/SUPPLY_CHAIN.md for the
# exact command that turns this into the lock and how to refresh it.
#
# The project itself, with every extra the build installs. It is not written
# to the lock (a local directory has no hash); build_macos.sh installs it
# separately with --no-deps, so it cannot pull anything unpinned.
-e .[gui,audio,asr,translate,dev,packaging]
# build_macos.sh installs the project with --no-build-isolation, so the
# build backend declared in pyproject.toml has to come from the lock too.
setuptools>=68
wheel
